OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather as funeral held for
OL,4,ASir Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FFriends, family and players past and
OL,7,Fpresent have gathered to pay their
OL,8,Frespects at the funeral of rugby league
OL,9,Flegend Sir Billy Boston.
OL,11,FBoston, who was the first player in
OL,12,Frugby league's 130-year history to
OL,13,Freceive a knighthood, died last month
OL,14,Faged 92.
OL,16,FHis funeral is taking at Wigan
OL,17,FWarriors' Brick Community Stadium, with
OL,18,Fmourners including many of the club's
OL,19,Fplayers.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
