OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather as funeral held for
OL,4,ASir Billy Boston
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore the service, a cortege travelled
OL,7,Fthrough Wigan on its route towards the
OL,8,Fstadium in the Greater Mancheser town.
OL,9,FA private burial ceremony was set to
OL,10,Ffollow.
